    "synthesis_rationale": "The final probability is the anchor adjusted downward by the strongest consistent signals (front-runner lead, western base-rate, and major polls). The tail-risk factor adds a tiny upward adjustment, but not enough to meaningfully move the estimate from near-zero. Correlations among polls and base-rate are accounted for, yielding a narrow calibrated range with low probability."
  }
